<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: rakkle -->
  <Xenotype_RakkleBase.label>拉克种</Xenotype_RakkleBase.label>
  <!-- EN: Rakkles are reptilian humanoids native to a remote planet at the Rim's edge.\n            After their discovery, human colonies rounded them up and delivered them to a\n            corporation known only as The Cradle, which first gave them near-human intelligence, and\n            then reshaped them into living products - docile, calculating predators engineered from\n            the ground up to swallow, hold and digest other living beings.\n\nEvery feature of a\n            Rakkle serves that purpose. Their legless bodies ride on a great coiling tail that hides\n            their vital organs and doubles as a limb strong enough to seize and pin struggling prey;\n            their numbing, venomous fangs and grasping hands subdue a meal; their ravenous carnivore\n            metabolism, oversized calorie reserves and swift digestion turn anything they swallow\n            into fuel. Their aggression was dampened and their appetite sharpened so the goods would\n            never bite the hand that sells them, while their skewed sex ratio and engineered\n            breeding cycle guarantee a steady supply of new stock.\n\nWithin The Cradle's\n            facilities, generation after generation was conditioned and raised as slaves, livestock\n            and toys, sold to whoever could pay. Wild Rakkles were hunted down to protect the\n            company's monopoly. After a series of escapes and revolts on planet after planet, a\n            coalition of freed Rakkle founded colonies of their own, fighting off capture and\n            invasion to build a world where their kind can live outside the yoke of slavery. Despite\n            The Cradle's best efforts, these settlements continue to grow in size and number. -->
  <Xenotype_RakkleBase.description>\n    拉克种是原生栖息在“边缘”一颗偏远星球上的爬行类人型生物。在被人类殖民者发现并聚集起来后，它们被交给了那家名为“响尾蛇”的公司——后者先赋予了它们近乎人类的智力，随后更把它们彻底重塑为一种活体商品：温顺而精于算计的捕食者，从身体构造上就是为了吞下、容纳并消化其他活体生物而生的。\n\n拉克种的每一处特征都服务于这一目的。它们没有双腿，全靠一条粗壮盘绕的尾巴行动——这条尾巴不仅藏匿着重要器官，还是足以卷住并压制挣扎猎物的肢体；它们带麻醉毒性的利牙与善于抓握的双手能够轻易制服食物；它们贪婪的食肉代谢、惊人的热量储备与迅速的消化能力，会把吞下的一切化为养分。它们的攻击性被削弱、食欲被强化，以确保这些“商品”不会反咬出售它们的手；而它们失衡的性别比例与经过设计的繁育周期，则保证了新货源的稳定供应。\n\n在“响尾蛇”的设施中，一代又一代的拉克种被驯化并被当作奴隶、牲畜和玩物养育，出售给任何出得起价钱的人。野生的拉克种遭到捕杀，以保护该公司的垄断。在经历了各星球上一系列逃亡与起义之后，一群获得自由的拉克种建立了属于自己的殖民地，抵御抓捕与入侵，力图打造一个拉克种能够摆脱奴隶制枷锁生活的新世界。尽管“响尾蛇”竭尽全力，这些定居点的规模和数量仍在持续增长。</Xenotype_RakkleBase.description>
  <!-- EN: Rakkles are reptilian humanoids genetically engineered by The Cradle into\n            living vore products: docile, near-human-intelligent predators built to swallow, hold\n            and digest other beings. Engineered aggression, boundless appetite and rapid digestion\n            keep the goods compliant - until a series of escapes and revolts gave rise to the free\n            Rakkle colonies. -->
  <Xenotype_RakkleBase.descriptionShort>\n    拉克种是被“响尾蛇”公司基因改造而成的活体吞噬商品：性情温顺、拥有近乎人类智力的捕食者，天生就是为了吞下、容纳并消化其他生物而生。经过设计的攻击性、无尽的食欲与迅捷的消化能力让这些“商品”保持驯服——直到一连串的逃亡与起义催生了自由拉克的殖民地。</Xenotype_RakkleBase.descriptionShort>
  
</LanguageData>